  <div class="self-select">
    <a class="self-select__door self-select__door--a" href="/govern-it/">
      <div class="self-select__door-inner">
        <p class="self-select__tag">You have the stack</p>
        <h2 class="self-select__headline">Govern It</h2>
        <p class="self-select__body">You already have Okta. You have cloud identity. Maybe NHI coverage. Your tooling is solid. What it can't give you is a name — a real person in the business who can say: that service account is mine, here's why it exists, and yes you can turn it off.</p>
        <span class="self-select__cta">See how it works →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="self-select__door self-select__door--b" href="/find-it/">
      <div class="self-select__door-inner">
