        <h2 class="self-select__headline">Find It</h2>
        <p class="self-select__body">You don't have a 20-person security team. You have a list of tools people say they're using — and a longer list of tools they actually are. You need to close that gap before it becomes an incident.</p>
        <span class="self-select__cta">See how it works →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
