        <h2 class="home-section__headline">A live register of every AI tool and system in use across your org.</h2>
        <p class="home-section__body">Not a snapshot. Not a report you run quarterly. A working register — discovered tools against known tools, updated continuously, with department-level attribution and usage context. When an auditor asks what AI tools you're using, you open Aurora.</p>
